/P 434 0 R
/T (And the work has been recognised. Inducted into the Geelong Business Excellence Awards Hall of Fame, Small Business of the Year, twice named a Health & Wellbeing Promoting Workplace, and awarded for corporate social responsibility. Seven Music Theatre Guild of Victoria nominations for Priscilla, including Production of the Year, and the Guild's Edith Harrhy Award. In 2024 our Managing Director, David Greenwood, was awarded the Medal of the Order of Australia for services to the performing arts and to business.)
/E (And the work has been recognised. Inducted into the Geelong Business Excellence Awards Hall of Fame, Small Business of the Year, twice named a Health & Wellbeing Promoting Workplace, and awarded for corporate social responsibility. Seven Music Theatre Guild of Victoria nominations for Priscilla, including Production of the Year, and the Guild's Edith Harrhy Award. In 2024 our Managing Director, David Greenwood, was awarded the Medal of the Order of Australia for services to the performing arts and to business.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [6]
>>
