4139 0 obj
<<
/Title (What you are watching tonight represents around nine months of work by well over a hundred people. There are the performers, whom you will see, and the creative team, whose names are printed a few pages from here. Then there is everybody else: the crew who move a castle in the dark in under ninety seconds, the wardrobe volunteers who have hand-finished more costumes than I can count, the parents who signed up to chaperone, the people who built the set in a shed on weekends, and the front of house team who will sell you an ice cream at interval and then go home and do it again tomorrow night.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4094 0 R
/Prev 4115 0 R
/Next 4167 0 R
>>
endobj
